---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const products = [
  { name: 'Workers', category: 'Compute', description: 'Your code. A global network. No servers to babysit.', href: 'https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/', glyph: '↗' },
  { name: 'R2', category: 'Object storage', description: 'Keep the files. Lose the egress fees.', href: 'https://developers.cloudflare.com/r2/', glyph: '▧' },
  { name: 'D1 + KV', category: 'Data', description: 'SQL and key-value storage, right in your stack.', href: 'https://developers.cloudflare.com/d1/', glyph: '≡' },
  { name: 'Durable Objects', category: 'State', description: 'Bring your multiplayer, chat, and collaboration to life.', href: 'https://developers.cloudflare.com/durable-objects/', glyph: '◎' },
  { name: 'Workers AI', category: 'Intelligence', description: 'Run models on serverless GPUs. Build what comes next.', href: 'https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers-ai/', glyph: '✳' },
  { name: 'Queues + Workflows', category: 'Background jobs', description: 'Keep work moving, even when a request is over.', href: 'https://developers.cloudflare.com/workflows/', glyph: '⇢' },
];
---
<Layout>
  <a class="skip" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
  <header class="navigation">
    <nav class="nav-inner" aria-label="Main navigation">
      <a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="Just Use Cloudflare home">justuse<span>cloudflare</span><span class="brand-dot">.</span></a>
      <div class="nav-links"><a href="#why">Why Cloudflare</a><a href="#platform">The platform</a><a href="#community">Community</a></div>
      <a class="nav-cta" href="https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/get-started/">Start building <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </nav>
  </header>
  <main id="main">
    <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
      <p class="eyebrow"><span class="tiny-line" aria-hidden="true"></span> A love letter to a better way to build</p>
      <h1 id="hero-title">Big ideas.<br />Small stack.<br /><span class="orange-text">Just Cloudflare.</span></h1>
      <p class="hero-copy">Your app, your data, your next big thing.<br class="desktop-break" /> On one seriously powerful developer platform.</p>
      <div class="actions"><a class="button" href="#why">See the difference <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a><a class="text-link" href="#platform">Meet your new stack <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
      <div class="hero-signoff"><span>LESS INFRASTRUCTURE.</span><span>MORE POSSIBILITY.</span></div>
    </section>

    <section class="intro section-width" id="why">
      <p class="eyebrow">The unfair advantage</p>
      <h2>Ambition shouldn’t<br />need an ops team.</h2>
      <p class="intro-copy">You came here to build something great. <strong>Cloudflare brings compute, storage, data, and AI together</strong> so you can spend more time on your product and less time stitching infrastructure together.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="advantages section-width" aria-label="Reasons to build on Cloudflare">
      <article class="feature global-feature">
        <div><p class="eyebrow">01 / Global compute</p><h3>Local idea.<br />Global ambition.</h3><p>Deploy Workers across Cloudflare’s global network. Reach your users without assembling a fleet of regional servers.</p><a class="text-link" href="https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/">Explore Workers <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
        <div class="global-type" aria-hidden="true"><span>BUILD</span><span>HERE.</span><span class="outline-type">RUN</span><span class="outline-type">EVERYWHERE.</span></div>
        <span class="feature-caption">One deployment. A worldwide platform.</span>
      </article>
      <article class="feature storage-feature">
        <p class="eyebrow">02 / Object storage</p><h3>Your data.<br />Free to leave.</h3>
        <div class="zero">$0<span>egress fees on R2</span></div>
        <p>Serve your files without a bandwidth toll from R2. A better starting point for media, downloads, and data-heavy ideas.</p>
        <a class="text-link" href="https://developers.cloudflare.com/r2/pricing/">See R2 pricing <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        <p class="fine-print">Storage and operations are billed separately. Retrieval fees apply to Infrequent Access. Other connected services may charge.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="feature pricing-feature">
        <p class="eyebrow">03 / Room to start</p><h3>Side-project friendly.<br />Big-project ready.</h3>
        <div class="price-display"><span>$5</span><span>/ month<br />Workers Paid minimum</span></div>
        <p>Start on the free plan. Move to paid when you need more. Included usage gives you room to build; additional usage and services cost extra.</p>
        <a class="text-link" href="https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/platform/pricing/">Understand the bill <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </article>
      <article class="feature together-feature">
        <p class="eyebrow">04 / Better together</p><h3>A whole platform.<br />Within reach.</h3>
        <div class="binding-demo" aria-label="Example of a Worker reading an R2 object"><div class="code-label">A WORKER + AN R2 BINDING</div><code><span class="code-purple">const</span> file = <span class="code-purple">await</span><br />env.<span class="code-orange">BUCKET</span>.get(<span class="code-green">"hello.txt"</span>);</code></div>
        <p>Connect your Worker to storage, databases, and other services with bindings. Fewer pieces to wire together. More time to ship.</p>
        <a class="text-link" href="https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/runtime-apis/bindings/">Discover bindings <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </article>
    </section>

    <section class="platform" id="platform">
      <div class="section-width">
        <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Meet the platform</p><h2>All the pieces.<br /><span class="muted">One place.</span></h2></div><p>From your first endpoint to your next AI app.<br />Pick what you need. Keep building.</p></div>
        <div class="product-grid">{products.map((product) => (
          <a class="product" href={product.href}><span class="product-top"><span class="product-icon" aria-hidden="true">{product.glyph}</span><span class="product-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span><span class="product-category">{product.category}</span><h3>{product.name}</h3><p>{product.description}</p></a>
        ))}</div>
        <p class="platform-note">Services have their own limits, availability, and pricing. <a href="https://developers.cloudflare.com/">Explore the documentation ↗</a></p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="manifesto section-width">
      <p class="eyebrow">Why just use Cloudflare?</p>
      <h2>Because the best part<br />of your stack should be<br /><span class="orange-text">what you build with it.</span></h2>
      <p>Global deployment. Zero-egress object storage. Services designed to connect. That’s a compelling default for modern web apps.</p>
      <a class="text-link" href="https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/platform/limits/">Check the fit for your workload <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </section>

    <section class="community section-width" id="community">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">Built on Cloudflare. Built by you.</p><h2>Great ideas<br />deserve a spotlight.</h2></div>
      <div><p>A community showcase of projects running on the Cloudflare developer platform is on the way.</p><p class="coming">Project submissions open at launch.</p><a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/Divkix/justusecloudflare.dev">Follow the project <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
    </section>

    <section class="closing">
      <p class="eyebrow">Your next idea is waiting.</p>
      <h2>Just build it.</h2>
      <a class="button" href="https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/get-started/">Start with Cloudflare <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      <p>Less setup. More shipping.</p>
    </section>
  </main>
  <footer class="section-width">
    <div class="footer-top"><a class="brand" href="/">justuse<span>cloudflare</span><span class="brand-dot">.</span></a><span>Made by <a href="https://divkix.me">Divkix ↗</a></span><a href="https://github.com/Divkix/justusecloudflare.dev">GitHub ↗</a></div>
    <p>Independent community project. Not affiliated with or endorsed by Cloudflare, Inc. Cloudflare and related marks are trademarks of Cloudflare, Inc.</p>
    <p>Pricing references checked September 14, 2026. See linked documentation for current pricing and limits. © 2026 justusecloudflare.dev</p>
  </footer>
</Layout>

<style>
  :global(*) { box-sizing: border-box; }
  :global(html) { scroll-behavior: smooth; scroll-padding-top: 6rem; }
  :global(body) { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif; color: #1d1d1f; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }
  :global(::selection) { background: #ffcaad; color: #151515; }
  a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
  a:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #bd4400; outline-offset: 6px; border-radius: 4px; }
  p { line-height: 1.6; }
  h1,h2,h3,p { margin: 0; }
  h1,h2,h3 { text-wrap: balance; }
  .section-width { width: min(1120px, calc(100% - 64px)); margin-inline: auto; }
  .skip { position: fixed; top: -100px; left: 16px; z-index: 100; padding: 12px 20px; background: #fff; }
  .skip:focus { top: 12px; }
  .navigation { position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 20; background: rgb(255 255 255 / .9); backdrop-filter: blur(20px); border-bottom: 1px solid #e9e9eb; }
  .nav-inner { max-width: 1200px; min-height: 72px; padding: 12px 32px; margin: auto; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 24px; }
  .brand { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -.7px; white-space: nowrap; }
  .brand span { font-weight: 750; }
  .brand .brand-dot { color: #e55f00; font-size: 25px; }
  .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 28px; font-size: 14px; color: #535356; }
  .nav-links a:hover, .text-link:hover, footer a:hover { color: #bc4300; }
  .nav-cta { padding: 10px 17px; background: #1d1d1f; color: white; border-radius: 99px; font-size: 14px; }
  .nav-cta:hover { background: #454547; }
  .eyebrow { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 650; letter-spacing: .1em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .hero { overflow: hidden; position: relative; text-align: center; padding: 92px 24px 0; background: radial-gradient(ellipse 65% 27% at 50% 105%, #ffae77 0%, #fff0e5 57%, transparent 100%), #fff; }
  .hero .eyebrow { color: #68686d; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 12px; }
  .tiny-line { height: 2px; width: 22px; background: #e96913; }
  h1 { font-size: clamp(64px, 7.6vw, 108px); line-height: 1.01; letter-spacing: -.065em; font-weight: 730; margin: 32px auto 25px; }
  .orange-text { color: #d94f00; }
  .hero-copy { color: #747479; font-size: clamp(18px, 2vw, 23px); line-height: 1.5; letter-spacing: -.4px; }
  .actions { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 28px; margin-top: 32px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .button { display: inline-flex; gap: 22px; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-height: 52px; padding: 15px 26px; border-radius: 99px; background: #ec650c; color: #111; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 650; transition: background .2s, transform .2s; }
  .button:hover { background: #ff812d; transform: translateY(-2px); }
  .text-link { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 550; display: inline-flex; gap: 12px; align-items: center; line-height: 1.5; }
  .hero-signoff { margin: 76px auto 0; padding: 27px 0; max-width: 800px; border-top: 1px solid #e7d6ca; display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 50px; color: #685b51; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: .15em; font-weight: 600; }
  .intro { padding-block: 125px 65px; }
  .intro .eyebrow, .section-heading .eyebrow, .manifesto .eyebrow, .community .eyebrow { color: #a23d00; margin-bottom: 24px; }
  h2 { font-size: clamp(38px, 5vw, 64px); line-height: 1.06; letter-spacing: -.05em; font-weight: 680; }
  .intro-copy { max-width: 660px; margin: 26px 0 0 auto; font-size: 23px; color: #77777c; line-height: 1.55; letter-spacing: -.5px; }
  .intro-copy strong { color: #1d1d1f; font-weight: 550; }
  .advantages { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.12fr 1fr; gap: 22px; padding-bottom: 120px; }
  .feature { min-width: 0; border-radius: 28px; padding: 40px; overflow: hidden; position: relative; }
  .feature h3 { font-size: clamp(30px, 3.3vw, 42px); line-height: 1.07; letter-spacing: -.045em; margin: 18px 0 24px; font-weight: 650; }
  .feature p:not(.eyebrow):not(.fine-print) { font-size: 17px; color: #6e6e73; max-width: 400px; }
  .feature .text-link { margin-top: 23px; }
  .global-feature { background: #101011; color: #f5f5f7; min-height: 640px; }
  .global-feature .eyebrow { color: #ffab70; }
  .global-feature p:not(.eyebrow):not(.fine-print) { color: #b3b3ba; }
  .global-feature .text-link { color: #ffab70; }
  .global-type { margin: 42px -12px 30px; font-size: clamp(40px, 4.3vw, 61px); font-weight: 800; line-height: .99; letter-spacing: -.055em; color: #ff8839; }
  .global-type span { display: block; }
  .outline-type { color: #28282c; -webkit-text-stroke: 1px #b4b4b9; }
  .feature-caption { display: block; color: #99999f; font-size: 13px; margin-top: 25px; }
  .storage-feature { background: #f5f5f7; min-height: 640px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; }
  .storage-feature .eyebrow, .pricing-feature .eyebrow { color: #77777b; }
  .zero { font-size: 144px; line-height: 1; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -.08em; margin: 15px 0 34px; color: #dd5400; }
  .zero span { display: block; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: -.4px; font-weight: 550; margin: 8px 0 0 8px; }
  .fine-print { font-size: 12px; color: #747479; line-height: 1.5; margin-top: auto; padding-top: 26px; }
  .pricing-feature { background: #f5f5f7; }
  .price-display { display: flex; gap: 24px; align-items: center; margin: 30px 0; }
  .price-display > span:first-child { font-size: 100px; font-weight: 650; line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -.075em; }
  .price-display > span:last-child { color: #737379; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; }
  .together-feature { background: #fff1e7; }
  .together-feature .eyebrow { color: #9b430d; }
  .binding-demo { background: #202022; color: #fff; padding: 23px; border-radius: 14px; margin: 28px 0; }
  .code-label { color: #aaaaaf; font: 11px/1.5 ui-monospace, monospace; letter-spacing: .08em; margin-bottom: 17px; }
  code { font: 16px/1.8 ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Consolas, monospace; }
  .code-purple { color: #d4baff; }.code-orange { color: #ffac74; }.code-green { color: #afe9c1; }
  .platform { background: #f5f5f7; padding-block: 100px; }
  .section-heading { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-end; gap: 32px; margin-bottom: 54px; }
  .muted { color: #858589; }
  .section-heading > p { font-size: 18px; color: #737378; padding-bottom: 5px; }
  .product-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 18px; }
  .product { background: #fff; border-radius: 22px; padding: 28px; transition: transform .25s, box-shadow .25s; }
  .product:hover { transform: translateY(-5px); box-shadow: 0 15px 30px #00000008; }
  .product-top { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 38px; }
  .product-icon { color: #cb4f00; font-size: 32px; line-height: 1; }
  .product-arrow { font-size: 21px; color: #88888e; }
  .product-category { font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .1em; color: #77777c; }
  .product h3 { font-size: 24px; letter-spacing: -.7px; margin-block: 8px 13px; }
  .product p { font-size: 16px; color: #737378; }
  .platform-note { font-size: 13px; color: #76767b; margin-top: 28px; }
  .platform-note a { text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
  .manifesto { text-align: center; padding-block: 135px; }
  .manifesto h2 { font-size: clamp(38px, 5.2vw, 70px); }
  .manifesto > p:not(.eyebrow) { max-width: 610px; margin: 30px auto 22px; color: #75757a; font-size: 20px; }
  .community { border-top: 1px solid #dedee2; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr; gap: 60px; padding-block: 65px 90px; align-items: center; }
  .community h2 { font-size: 43px; }
  .community > div > p:not(.eyebrow) { color: #717177; font-size: 18px; }
  .community .coming { margin-top: 16px; }
  .community .text-link { margin-top: 22px; }
  .closing { text-align: center; padding: 100px 24px; background: #111112; color: #fff; }
  .closing .eyebrow { color: #b0b0b6; }
  .closing h2 { font-size: clamp(72px, 10vw, 132px); letter-spacing: -.065em; margin: 23px 0 35px; }
  .closing > p:last-child { color: #a0a0a7; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 23px; }
  footer { padding-block: 38px; }
  .footer-top { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 22px; margin-bottom: 30px; font-size: 14px; }
  footer > p { font-size: 12px; color: #737378; max-width: 880px; margin-top: 9px; }
  @media (max-width: 850px) {
    .nav-links { display: none; }
    .hero { padding-top: 72px; }
    .advantages { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 16px; }
    .feature { padding: 28px; }
    .global-type { font-size: 39px; margin-inline: 0; }
    .zero { font-size: 120px; }
    .product-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
    .section-heading { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; }
    .community { gap: 30px; }
    .binding-demo { padding: 18px; }
    code { font-size: 13px; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .section-width { width: calc(100% - 36px); }
    .nav-inner { padding-inline: 18px; min-height: 64px; gap: 12px; }
    .brand { font-size: 15px; }
    .nav-cta { font-size: 12px; padding: 9px 12px; }
    .hero { padding: 58px 18px 0; }
    .hero .eyebrow { font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: .08em; }
    h1 { font-size: clamp(45px, 11.7vw, 70px); margin-top: 26px; }
    .hero-copy { font-size: 18px; }
    .actions { gap: 21px; flex-direction: column; margin-top: 27px; }
    .hero-signoff { margin-top: 53px; gap: 20px; font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: .08em; }
    .intro { padding-block: 76px 38px; }
    .intro-copy { font-size: 19px; }
    .advantages { grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding-bottom: 72px; }
    .feature { padding: 30px; border-radius: 23px; min-height: auto; }
    .global-type { font-size: clamp(34px, 9.7vw, 55px); margin-block: 45px 30px; }
    .feature h3 { font-size: 36px; }
    .zero { margin-block: 20px 30px; }
    .fine-print { padding-top: 24px; }
    .platform { padding-block: 70px; }
    .product-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 13px; }
    .product-top { margin-bottom: 24px; }
    .product { padding: 26px; }
    .manifesto { padding-block: 78px; }
    .manifesto > p:not(.eyebrow) { font-size: 18px; }
    .community { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 24px; padding-block: 48px 64px; }
    .community h2 { font-size: 38px; }
    .closing { padding-block: 75px; }
    .closing h2 { font-size: clamp(57px, 15vw, 85px); }
    .footer-top { flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .footer-top .brand { width: 100%; }
    code { font-size: 15px; }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    :global(html) { scroll-behavior: auto; }
    .button, .product { transition: none; }
    .button:hover, .product:hover { transform: none; }
  }
</style>
